WEBVTT

00:02:58.676 --> 00:03:00.356
And it is in their interest,

00:03:00.396 --> 00:03:03.036
in their personal and financial interest,

00:03:03.076 --> 00:03:06.596
to understand the consequences
of a warming planet.

00:03:07.396 --> 00:03:09.636
The strangeness or weirdness
of these signs --

00:03:09.636 --> 00:03:12.676
remember, these aren't political signs
or "home for sale" signs,

00:03:12.716 --> 00:03:14.156
these are elevation markers --

00:03:14.156 --> 00:03:18.156
is a key component
to a socially engaged project

00:03:18.196 --> 00:03:21.876
that makes random people stop
long enough to ask,

00:03:21.916 --> 00:03:23.196
"What is this about?"

00:03:23.916 --> 00:03:25.516
And it is in that way

00:03:25.556 --> 00:03:27.196
that many of my neighbors realized

00:03:27.236 --> 00:03:30.556
that although they lived
farther inland from the ocean,